<title>INDIA: India 96/97 GDP growth could top 6.8 pct -minister.</title>
<headline>India 96/97 GDP growth could top 6.8 pct -minister.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian Planning Minister Yogendra Alagh said on Thursday that the growth rate of gross domestic product (GDP) in 1996/97 (April-March) will likely exceed the latest official estimate of 6.8 percent.</p>
</text>
